{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>名模林志玲前年在台鐵平溪支線上放天燈，近日傳出台灣鐵路警察局接獲檢舉她違法放天燈，傳訊未到案後已移交鐵道局裁罰。鐵道局不證實是否已開罰，僅表示若確有違法最重可裁處五萬元（台幣，下同，約12,100港元）罰款；林志玲則直言：「會乖乖去繳罰金，謝謝大家的關心。」也呼籲遊客在合法區域施放天燈。</p><p>台灣鐵道局統計，近五年就約有六十多件因拍照或放天燈等闖入平溪線挨罰的案例。為了不讓執法和觀光衝突，鐵道局今年初已修法明定「原則禁止、例外許可」，但公告至今沒有相關單位申請。</p><figure><img alt=\"AKIRA（左）前年帶著林志玲與兒子，一家三口到台灣新北市平溪十分放天燈為愛妻慶生。（翻攝自Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159107438889144320785920.jpeg/x5cyUw0QYYjjwuawgLrV42unoSSILMqV_FPUtPxT1LQ\"/><figcaption>AKIRA（左）前年帶著林志玲與兒子，一家三口到台灣新北市平溪十分放天燈為愛妻慶生。（翻攝自Instagram）</figcaption></figure><p>點圖看看名模女神林志玲近期靚相：</p><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109071945601024741965.jpeg/7I5YNI6mw5B-mgKaMngj70Fx8cZaY6qskmHmcZJh5nE\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109068976164864712409.jpeg/hjzqYe5rnb1H9_UzG7ntJPWzzVx9M7uGxCQq6MQkKug\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109071203471360028761.jpeg/v6wDOqIM0j_8GKTrsnv5u2CDhhYG2mabgEGH-IBBh_g\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109072125956096623095.jpeg/G-UXEfHszRBIFcSnxp8d55U9FQDuHB1CCv7QDQr-0A0\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109073661464576143675.jpeg/ECZBSOxwzvoO7p3GqT_Dz1W5hV0Ju4YkNpPuszaT7rM\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109066602057728789214.jpeg/7ElUYbim1saEBxutGyNhqMSiEuuvCKJeBLe5iAS3uYg\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109076182372352478321.jpeg/z_ez8I_DlCtiTvPaQAK_27Yfm7e_mmDLhEB1n4RAdZ8\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109074730749952985246.jpeg/npI7IPEW7Dtm3EDMhPdyiHt7lMHQA0ZDMOWvqjDlr6o\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109077528481792983527.jpeg/DYh26UUdw_Gh8pknuR3rvmmeUlOfdmt0VLZvMFS2bzA\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109080502374400401829.jpeg/DPwEEPobzOyZHINEt4vOG52_w3eWDxID8pbTdfKW03U\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109083576930304023965.jpeg/Y6FSl-HNHJ0nY76Fj1h3A_92K5ISPVOsQq2_UkKtv1I\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109074911105024650938.jpeg/K6aTFojUGuMCfZ1KkRTsZwiBBO-X2BaP8wUAzvMFAM4\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109077746585600432901.jpeg/AkhIBFTDiiH8XN7rz2fZjHGkLigh0AiOzw93Ys8Pd2I\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109080221356032405893.jpeg/AX9Zj9OURRVE692Fji42zWJW8fRJGey0HVDzNx1Q8zc\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159109082658377728053164.jpeg/DZmWL7A2N-5ilgB1Bae4QmCpABGgosTU_U5CIv1OQiI\"/><figcaption>名模林志玲（圖/翻攝自Instagram@chiling.lin）</figcaption></figure><p>林志玲前年和老公Akira帶著兒子到新北平溪十分，在社交網站曬出一家三口站在鐵軌上放天燈的天倫照片。知名旅遊網紅夫妻檔去年因在十分老街鐵軌上拍照挨罰一萬元（約2,400港元），當時就有人質疑為何林志玲沒事。</p><p>不過事隔兩年，鐵警局突獲檢舉，6月二度傳訊林志玲均未到案，案件移交鐵道局裁罰。鐵道局證實，將依照相關事證審酌，若確有違法侵入鐵軌事實，將依鐵路法及行政程序法辦理裁處一萬至五萬元（約2,400至12,100港元）罰款。</p><p>遊客在平溪老街鐵道上施放天燈、拍照已成常態，當地商家形成「鐵道天燈」商業模式，帶買天燈的民眾在鐵道上或周邊施放，幫忙拍照。只要火車一靠近，就有人高喊「火車來了，大家快離開」，遊客才緊急散開。一名菲律賓籍遊客說：「我們都是聽業者說的方式來施放，根本不知道站哪裡合法，哪裡違法。」</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：51歲林志玲時隔八年復出客串楊紫新劇　零修圖旗袍照曝光驚艷網民】林志玲51歲旗袍生圖（微博@薰衣草Sallie）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260126/1092507271163809792635084.jpeg/3BkjAkZzG5tdzIaP8BkpTDoR3O_kd_JDIKUfMiClHzI\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：51歲林志玲時隔八年復出客串楊紫新劇　零修圖旗袍照曝光驚艷網民】林志玲51歲旗袍生圖（微博@薰衣草Sallie）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲51歲旗袍生圖（微博@吃瓜衝浪日記）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260126/1092507517465923584804132.jpeg/wC3mE_vbKDvjwpcJ59GsMHEekQZg4rZdRLoaWUS6Glk\"/><figcaption>林志玲51歲旗袍生圖（微博@吃瓜衝浪日記）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲51歲旗袍生圖（微博@吃瓜衝浪日記）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260126/1092507519630315520917380.jpeg/4wiKJhcxTCHEIIpfyrZRgBPmYfWdl1jY7U4GM-1OBjM\"/><figcaption>林志玲51歲旗袍生圖（微博@吃瓜衝浪日記）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲51歲旗袍生圖（微博@吃瓜衝浪日記）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260126/1092507521782124544301264.jpeg/tLTiMdAmzrWHZhkT_TDtAmoIf01ZH3eKljZmwZY2ZsE\"/><figcaption>林志玲51歲旗袍生圖（微博@吃瓜衝浪日記）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲慶祝51歲生日。(小紅書)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251204/1073232946279878656238506.jpeg/ruw5HU-6b_1tnJ1qgwYGKTtqGaSnlBTt4B-CweAfgsE\"/><figcaption>林志玲慶祝51歲生日。(小紅書)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225230274236416726890.png/4s6rkOs7_7-HRg-_EqduroHLOmW0BQyiK3j8dCt4_HQ\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225227849797632894235.png/11fgRfkHysv3Gu2CgVSgVVoDWnBj8jngIdiCAiHYggI\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225229779308544729130.png/Syji3epptwT9rnimuhkJeBkEK_SLmblaNa7gTTWu4E0\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225227254206464724180.png/Y4uKb-zOK3VNdXPnKImjw-pIezQr9w4Kb3IsFW9yLBU\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225227833020416659813.png/oU2RTho1H4_4BnI09gT9sbBLgpvsqvXGeOJ-gnjifoI\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225224536166400672315.png/j6Wldulnoy8E90w05hSerFcSMKKneUis7FGzPuxRsz4\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225224095895552208461.png/1iC0g1QTpx9zceog6IMTjgfP2x-o3V-eaw9L3msPS94\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225226797158400250684.png/2mdVgB1Bh4MOolpfGCeY17UB6REWg0jT_x4vhP8eL4Q\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225230634946560249013.png/wlwiyAJCL3E-85zlPRbeS75aKXBZ0bt5RbNJ0UWzSdE\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225224460668928271348.png/Vt6DAeO1lg6P2T7_Q8du6m4aY0A0NqUDRtHkakbR5Go\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225224024461312562914.png/4eJqpFtYt7p4gwNM8jaUODWE6u7TIQ9VtjnDfrY5w34\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225221725851648892341.png/x3IxpcD98w7g-H6DvzlWoJHnUsq1cygcSoW1WEqFtVg\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225222057201664315408.png/1dfAIkn8LPLfJBU7XXXEGd_z_LhmRUikS64ZvUuuGb0\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225218970193920517843.png/dxBuLnoEnPuP-Qk-4_SC4KMKAazyTQBWvKHbPryh2z4\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225219095891968732814.png/_tqws3ixlnCXzPesUmok6hFg65YqNqOYOg4_LDoOPyw\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225221616930816904527.png/B3ky5g-nFhb4zGNXzp_rmYkE_vak6_sWVvTxrVb08a0\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225221709074432058624.png/RF2H7xnch8xdua02Si4rg0SzMp-R33iar8RGta_ERrU\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225219183972352832769.png/gSB__yFn3RS0At3T-AsIczYpq6s3XWXCSzjXx0s418c\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225219607597056415962.png/ZFZms7OIVinGybM6_omc2Y3O3M8SvSMenpE7y56RO8s\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225216461869056940752.png/cWEwonHXgVzzNqxtQJTjeDK8IarrCvL8fQJnLH0CZyw\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225214713106432420385.png/EPOhFajFQ8zSbs76GbLrekKDjv-ierk-EA10ahANdGo\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225212141867008593672.png/XW14ud7-PHV4IvVNDjOtvj0rOLvMGrYFhCN3iIQjd4g\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林志玲（微博@林志玲）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250602/1006225209641930752485712.png/hOY_uA5N8rEWYSrCtUaOBuK44eowiTfQ1xznH9cc5x8\"/><figcaption>林志玲（微博@林志玲）</figcaption></figure><p>旅客到平溪觀光常少不了要放天燈，卻不見得知道在鐵道放天燈竟是「觀光陷阱」。就曾有旅客聽從店家指示卻遭檢舉開罰。</p><p>手拿空罐也不行？台女在匈牙利地鐵站挨罰 網揭「專抓外國人」惹議</p><p>颱風「白海豚」升級中颱 最新路徑出爐</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T05:01:50.586116+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1714,"images":44,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}